{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Back when I played auto battlers, most had fantasy themes. But as a WWII enthusiast, I always wanted to create a historically grounded version. That's how this WWII equipment-themed auto battler came to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Taking advantage of the depth in a 2D board, I designed some fun units. I hope you enjoy playing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-There is a &quot;combat width&quot; mechanic, which limits how many units you can deploy in a single row. Also, the game only features asynchronous multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The game supports the Steam Workshop, allowing you to create new units, mix and match skills for existing ones, design enemy lineups, adjust starting funds, change background music, modify combat width, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554830/extras/d3765dbdae3d1cc0d05d679d099a73a3.poster.avif?t=1760426418\" width=1238 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554830/extras/d3765dbdae3d1cc0d05d679d099a73a3.webm?t=1760426418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554830/extras/d3765dbdae3d1cc0d05d679d099a73a3.mp4?t=1760426418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554830/extras/5b829ab35772241312de71a8caab16a1.poster.avif?t=1760426418\" width=1238 height=526 >